OL,3,GNEWSAMajor rail disruption after
OL,4,Aoverhead wires damaged
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll railway lines through Stockport
OL,7,Frail station have been closed after
OL,8,Fdamage to overhead electrical wires
OL,9,Fcaused major disruption services.
OL,11,FNational Rail said trains were being
OL,12,Fcancelled, diverted or stopped short of
OL,13,Ftheir destinations while repairs were
OL,14,Fcarried out.
OL,16,FSix operators have been affected
OL,17,Fincluding Avanti West Coast, Northern,
OL,18,FCrossCountry, East Midlands Railway,
OL,19,FTransPennine Express and Transport for
OL,20,FWales.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
